---
import { ArrowUpRight, Award, CheckCircle2, Clock } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section id="personal" class="py-20 w-full flex flex-col items-center">
  {/* Fila de Introducción */}
  <div class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:gap-12 items-start lg:items-end justify-between mb-16">
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex gap-2 items-center" data-section-label>
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DA2984] to-transparent h-px w-10"></div>
        <p class="font-mono font-medium text-[#DA2984] text-sm tracking-[2.88px] uppercase">PARTICULARES</p>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white">Destraba tu carrera técnica hoy mismo</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 max-w-[500px]">
      <p class="text-white/60 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        El salto de la universidad o del autoaprendizaje al mercado real es difícil. Deja de acumular tutoriales y empieza a recibir feedback directo de un Senior Developer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Fila de Contenedores (2 Cards Grandes Lado a Lado) */}
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 w-full items-stretch">
    
    {/* Card A: Sesión de Claridad */}
    <div class="reveal-card interactive-card relative rounded-[32px] border border-[#DA2984]/20 overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8 sm:p-10 min-h-[380px] group transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:border-[#DA2984]/40">
      {/* Fondo glass y orbe decorativo */}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-[#100a1c]/80 to-[#0f0a1a]/95 backdrop-blur-xl -z-10"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-[120px] -left-[120px] w-[240px] h-[240px] rounded-full blur-[80px] bg-[#DA2984]/15 group-hover:bg-[#DA2984]/25 transition-colors duration-700"></div>

      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
          <div class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-[#DA2984]/10 border border-[#DA2984]/20 rounded-full">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#DA2984] tracking-wider uppercase">Inicial</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-white/35 font-mono flex items-center gap-1">
            <Clock size={12} /> 20 min gratis
          </span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Sesión de Claridad</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Una llamada de 20 minutos para auditar tu enfoque profesional, revisar tu stack o guiarte en tu proyecto actual.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-2.5 mb-8">
          {["Auditoría rápida de tu stack", "Identificación de bloqueadores", "Consejo directo para tu carrera"].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80">
              <CheckCircle2 size={16} class="text-[#DA2984]/70 shrink-0" />
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <a href="https://calendly.com/tokidev/sesion-gratuita" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#DA2984] to-[#A406E9] rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white hover:brightness-110 shadow-lg shadow-purple-900/30 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer">
        Agendar 20 min Gratis
        <ArrowUpRight size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Card B: Mentoría Personalizada */}
    <div class="reveal-card interactive-card relative rounded-[32px] border border-[#A406E9]/20 overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8 sm:p-10 min-h-[380px] group transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.01] hover:border-[#A406E9]/40">
      {/* Fondo glass y orbe decorativo */}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-[#100a1c]/80 to-[#0f0a1a]/95 backdrop-blur-xl -z-10"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-[120px] -left-[120px] w-[240px] h-[240px] rounded-full blur-[80px] bg-[#A406E9]/15 group-hover:bg-[#A406E9]/25 transition-colors duration-700"></div>

      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
          <div class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-[#A406E9]/10 border border-[#A406E9]/20 rounded-full">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#A406E9] tracking-wider uppercase">Avanzado</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-white/35 font-mono flex items-center gap-1">
            <Award size={12} class="text-[#A406E9]" /> Premium 1:1
          </span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Mentoría Personalizada</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Sesiones premium enfocadas en dominar Angular, Node.js, patrones de diseño y simulación de entrevistas técnicas reales.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-2.5 mb-8">
          {["Revisión de código y arquitectura", "Preparación para entrevistas técnicas", "Roadmap de carrera a medida"].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80">
              <CheckCircle2 size={16} class="text-[#A406E9]/70 shrink-0" />
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <a href="mailto:rodrigo.torricodelcastillo@gmail.com?subject=Consulta%20disponibilidad%20mentoria%20premium" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-4 bg-white/7 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/12 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer">
        Consultar Disponibilidad
        <ArrowUpRight size={16} class="text-[#A406E9]" />
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
